{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Looking for Another Chance "}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work context Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work context"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work context"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work context Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go south"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to turn out badly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A few interviews have gone south lately."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about preparing an elevator pitch."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "elevator pitch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short speech used to get an employer's attention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have an elevator pitch?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "discouraged"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "frustrated due to lack of success"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm getting a little discouraged."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "speech"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a message delivered orally"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: An \"elevator pitch\" is a short, pre-prepared speech that explains what you want to do."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "complicated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " difficult; complex "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It needn't be very long or complicated."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in demand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a lot of need for people in a certain area, or a particular product or  Something that is wanted or desired. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ever since I read a book on digital media, I have been convinced that there careers in communications will be in demand in the future. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Solving Problems: Infinitives and Gerunds (Passive Forms)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Gerunds</span> are <span class=\"strong\">nouns</span> derived from <span class=\"strong\">verbs</span>.  A <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> is a <span class=\"strong\">verb</span> with an \u2013ing, e.g. <span class=\"italic\">taking</span>, <span class=\"italic\">asking</span>, <span class=\"italic\">organizing</span>. They are used as any other <span class=\"strong\">noun</span> is used. They sometimes can be used to describe general activities or abstract ideas. <br/>For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Using digital media is a modern method to get a job. </span> <br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Infinitives</span> are the base or simple form of a <span class=\"strong\">verb</span> and contain the word to. <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> is usually used with an <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span> or an object + an <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span>. <br/>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I need to prepare for a situation like that.</span><span class=\"italic\">"}, {"type": "text", "content": "After certain <span class=\"strong\">verbs</span> (like <span class=\"italic\">need</span> and<span class=\"italic\"> require</span>), the <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> takes on a passive meaning on its own. You do not need to use the passive voice.  </br></br>For example:  </br><span class=\"italic\">This report needs rewriting = This report needs to be rewritten.</br>Your pitch requires practicing = Your pitch needs to be practiced."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Your ideas require organizing in advance.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Your pitch needs to be written with a clear objective in mind."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then, your pitch needs to be practiced."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember that whether you use a <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span> or <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span> after certain <span class=\"strong\">verbs</span> can affect the meaning of what you want to say."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Necessity: <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Needn't</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">need</span> to express necessity - when something has to be done. This is out of obligation or due to a set protocol at work or in a social setting. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you want to talk about when something is not necessary, use the modal <span class=\"italic\">needn't</span> (not<span class=\"italic\"> mustn't</span>, which refers to something that is prohibited, rather that not necessary)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> Your pitch needn't be very long or complicated.  </br></br>You needn't spend a lot of time preparing a long speech. </br></br>You mustn't feel ashamed of asking for help. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online. Find out what jobs are expected to be in demand in the future. Find 10 different jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Visit at least 3 different websites to compare answers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Organize the jobs into different career fields (for example: healthcare, technology, agriculture, etc.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share the results of your study with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about which jobs you would like to have and which jobs you would not like to have."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read about jobs in demand in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I organize the jobs into career fields."}, {"type": "text", "content": " I discuss future jobs with a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>:  You must be Adam! Welcome!\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  Thank you, Mr. Goldstein. I really appreciate you taking the time to meet with me today.\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: My pleasure, young man. You mustn't feel ashamed of asking for help.  As soon as young people graduate, they need to start looking for a job. Often, they must continue looking for a very long time.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm getting a little discouraged. A few interviews have gone south lately.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: I understand. You're looking for another chance.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, I really want to work in communications.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: Excellent. Ever since I read a book on digital media, I have been convinced that their careers in communications will be in demand in the future. Do you have an elevator pitch?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What's that?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: An \"elevator pitch\" is a short, pre-prepared speech that explains what you want to do. The goal is to make someone interested in your ideas while you are going up 5 floors on an elevator.", "id": 2, "time": "24500", "image": "engenn10le03ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's not much time.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: No, it's not.  Imagine you've just bumped into a former colleague at the airport. He asks you what you are presently doing. You want to talk about your plans, and maybe schedule a meeting. As you try to organize your thoughts, his flight is called, and he's on his way. Your ideas require organizing in advance.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That makes a lot of sense. I need to prepare for a situation like that.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mr. Goldstein</span>: Your pitch needs to be written with a clear objective in mind. It needn't be very long or complicated. You should also use and emphasize key words, like action verbs or adjectives. Then, your pitch needs to be practiced.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I guess I'll be going up and down a lot of elevators in near future!", "id": 3, "time": "49000", "image": "engenn10le03ob03re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can exchange opinions about events or actions related to work and jobs. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about solving problems. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express necessity, duty, and advice about a work-related process."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you find easy or difficult about talking about your background? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you like talking about your hopes and plans for the future? Why or why not? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Want to hear my elevator pitch?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Adam meets with Mr. Goldstein, the headhunter. He recommends using <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">digital media</span>."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": 